codex
The root cause is now concrete: this container’s PID namespace is not represented by the mounted `/proc`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its executable through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe` instead of `/proc/self/exe`. I’m applying a minimal audit-local `readlink` shim that redirects only that exact proc-path pattern to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not touch any mounted evidence or generated source. Then I’ll rerun the trusted preflight unchanged under the pinned toolchain.
apply patch
